<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Oct Treasury deficit $537 mln - official.</title>
<headline>Argentine Oct Treasury deficit $537 mln - official.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Treasury deficit in October, including income from privatizations, was $537 million, down from a $640 million shortfall in the same month last year, the government said Thursday.</p>
<p>Total revenue in October was $1.22 billion and total expenditures were $1.75 billion.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
